1
00:00:02,469 --> 00:00:06,534
[Subtitles by danielsangeo]

2
00:00:07,128 --> 00:00:08,463
Well, that's it.

3
00:00:08,463 --> 00:00:10,935
I've gone and killed two guys.

4
00:00:10,935 --> 00:00:14,388
All my life, I've wanted to kill
people just by pressing a button.

5
00:00:14,388 --> 00:00:15,864
And now that I've done it,

6
00:00:15,864 --> 00:00:18,638
it's... just... not what
I was hoping for.

7
00:00:18,638 --> 00:00:20,895
How am I going to get out of here now?

8
00:00:20,895 --> 00:00:22,665
Oh, sweet, a service ladder.

9
00:00:22,665 --> 00:00:26,706
Seems like stairs would've made
more sense but that's not my problem,

10
00:00:26,706 --> 00:00:28,667
for I am the climbing master.

11
00:00:29,658 --> 00:00:31,674
Hey, that's the problem:

12
00:00:31,674 --> 00:00:35,310
I didn't KNOW I was killing
anybody; it was manslaughter.

13
00:00:35,310 --> 00:00:38,138
I should've--whoa-ho-ho!
Better not look down.

14
00:00:38,138 --> 00:00:40,355
"Manslaughter" sounds
worse than "murder",

15
00:00:40,355 --> 00:00:43,943
like I'm a butcher in some evil meat shop
and ground up a bunch of people to--

16
00:00:43,943 --> 00:00:46,510
[gunshots, zombie squealing]
Uh-oh! Gunshots! Somebody's going postal.

17
00:00:46,510 --> 00:00:47,809
[gunshots, zombie squealing]
I knew this would happen.

18
00:00:47,809 --> 00:00:50,294
Wait, that's not... what is that?

19
00:00:50,294 --> 00:00:52,092
Maybe I should be more like this guy.

20
00:00:52,092 --> 00:00:54,701
If he doesn't know what something is,
he just shoots it dead.

21
00:00:54,701 --> 00:00:58,111
GUARD: Gordon! Man am I glad to
see you! What the hell are these things?

22
00:00:58,111 --> 00:00:58,659
GUARD: And why are they

23
00:00:58,659 --> 00:01:00,801
GUARD: wearing Science Team uniforms?
Whoa! Quick draw!

24
00:01:01,136 --> 00:01:02,334
YEAH! SHOOT IT!

25
00:01:02,979 --> 00:01:04,194
HELL YEAH!

26
00:01:04,194 --> 00:01:08,030
That was bad ass. I can
see why you took this job.

27
00:01:08,030 --> 00:01:11,240
Still, what is going on?!

28
00:01:11,240 --> 00:01:13,239
Is this guy contagious?

29
00:01:13,239 --> 00:01:14,329
I'm getting out of here.

30
00:01:14,329 --> 00:01:16,215
I hope I'm not infected.

31
00:01:16,215 --> 00:01:19,626
I'll never get a date if I end
up looking like those guys.

32
00:01:19,626 --> 00:01:21,828
Oh boy! Another body.

33
00:01:21,828 --> 00:01:25,228
Y'know, normally following a
trail of bodies covered in blood

34
00:01:25,228 --> 00:01:27,601
is a sign you're going the WRONG way.

35
00:01:28,331 --> 00:01:29,767
[singing]
Follow the dead body road.

36
00:01:30,050 --> 00:01:31,400
[singing]
Follow the dead body road.

37
00:01:31,672 --> 00:01:32,276
[singing]
Follow, fol--

38
00:01:32,276 --> 00:01:34,301
Damn! Look at all that blood.

39
00:01:34,301 --> 00:01:37,926
That must be a few hundred dollars'
worth if you were to donate all that.

40
00:01:37,926 --> 00:01:39,948
I wonder if the organs are still good.

41
00:01:39,948 --> 00:01:42,789
I could make a fortune selling
them from all these dead guys.

42
00:01:42,789 --> 00:01:46,544
I guess I could still sell the cadavers if
I could move them before the cops arrive.

43
00:01:46,544 --> 00:01:48,968
Nah, they'd probably just
try to arrest me again.

44
00:01:49,668 --> 00:01:52,801
Oh no! It's the ghosts of those
two guys coming back to haunt me!

45
00:01:53,297 --> 00:01:55,142
Oh, wait. They're just monsters.

46
00:01:55,142 --> 00:01:56,851
Uh...what do I do?

47
00:01:56,851 --> 00:02:00,534
Oh, I know. I'll stand still. They'll pass by
me because they don't have any eyes.

48
00:02:01,698 --> 00:02:02,368
AAAH!

49
00:02:02,368 --> 00:02:04,124
Dammit! How did they see me?

50
00:02:04,124 --> 00:02:07,344
That is so unfair! They don't
have any eyes!

51
00:02:07,344 --> 00:02:10,334
This place bites. I'm going to
find another job.

52
00:02:10,985 --> 00:02:12,766
Oh good! More blood!

53
00:02:12,766 --> 00:02:14,462
I was starting to get worried!

54
00:02:14,462 --> 00:02:15,891
God, what happened?

55
00:02:15,891 --> 00:02:18,394
This guy looks like he got hit
by a steamroller.

56
00:02:18,394 --> 00:02:19,395
[explosion]
Gah!

57
00:02:19,395 --> 00:02:20,871
Why did THAT blow up?

58
00:02:20,871 --> 00:02:24,209
Did we wire this place to
self-destruct or something?

59
00:02:24,209 --> 00:02:26,868
I guess we don't have enough
dead people here yet.

60
00:02:26,868 --> 00:02:28,200
I've got to get out of here.

61
00:02:28,948 --> 00:02:29,710
[panel buzzes]

62
00:02:29,710 --> 00:02:31,582
Oh, you've gotta be shitting me...

63
00:02:31,582 --> 00:02:35,553
I'm going to sue the HELL out of
Black Mesa when I get out of here!

64
00:02:35,553 --> 00:02:37,360
Locking your workers in?

65
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:40,135
That's what the
Triangle Shirtwaist Factory did;

66
00:02:40,135 --> 00:02:43,853
locked its workers in, then there
was a fire then everybody died.

67
00:02:43,853 --> 00:02:46,048
That's a formula for success!

68
00:02:46,048 --> 00:02:46,901
DAMMIT!

69
00:02:47,348 --> 00:02:49,741
Wow, we're making history right now!

70
00:02:49,741 --> 00:02:51,400
CRAP HISTORY!

71
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:52,703
[explosion]
RRRRR!

72
00:02:52,703 --> 00:02:53,383
What?

73
00:02:53,383 --> 00:02:54,033
Ha-hah!

74
00:02:54,393 --> 00:02:55,791
I am incredible.

75
00:02:55,791 --> 00:02:58,884
Is there any end to the number
of problems I can solve

76
00:02:58,884 --> 00:03:01,150
just by beating the
hell out of something?

77
00:03:01,150 --> 00:03:03,374
I'm not sure there is!

78
00:03:03,374 --> 00:03:06,341
Yep! That's how I say "Open sesame":

79
00:03:06,341 --> 00:03:08,796
with a crowbar to the face!

80
00:03:08,796 --> 00:03:10,972
Aw man, the tram's gone.

81
00:03:10,972 --> 00:03:12,567
You're waiting for it too, huh?

82
00:03:13,283 --> 00:03:15,100
Hey, you sure this catwalk's safe?

83
00:03:16,004 --> 00:03:17,548
Hey, why is the guard dead?

84
00:03:17,548 --> 00:03:18,389
You kill him?

85
00:03:18,389 --> 00:03:19,795
[metal groaning]
I want some answers!

86
00:03:19,795 --> 00:03:20,253
[metal groaning]
Uh-oh.

87
00:03:20,253 --> 00:03:21,488
SCIENTIST: No! Stay back!

88
00:03:21,488 --> 00:03:23,023
SCIENTIST: GORDON!
Oh jeez. Okay, give me your hand!

89
00:03:23,023 --> 00:03:26,107
[scientist screams]
No, your OTHER hand, you idiot!

90
00:03:26,107 --> 00:03:28,000
[distant splat]
Ah, you suck!

91
00:03:28,903 --> 00:03:32,192
Now you're dead and I STILL
can't get out of here!

92
00:03:32,192 --> 00:03:34,350
Thanks for nothing!

93
00:03:34,350 --> 00:03:37,062
Why does everyone have to keep dying on me?

94
00:03:37,062 --> 00:03:40,458
Is it really so hard to just not die?

95
00:03:40,458 --> 00:03:41,661
I mean, look at me.

96
00:03:41,661 --> 00:03:45,472
I was in the chamber at friggin'
Ground Zero and I'm still here!

97
00:03:45,472 --> 00:03:48,621
Yet, you guys slip on
a banana peel and that's it!

98
00:03:48,621 --> 00:03:53,916
Ugh, Darwin was right. I didn't realize
I was working with a bunch of lemmings.

99
00:03:53,916 --> 00:03:56,467
I guess I may as well
check that opening out.

100
00:03:56,467 --> 00:03:58,990
I'll go around so I don't have
to walk in the blood.

101
00:03:58,990 --> 00:04:00,436
Though, honestly, at the rate I'm going,

102
00:04:00,436 --> 00:04:01,565
I'll be knee deep in it

103
00:04:01,565 --> 00:04:02,976
[techno music]
before I get out of here.

104
00:04:02,976 --> 00:04:04,870
[techno music]
At least they turned the volume down.

105
00:04:04,870 --> 00:04:05,621
[techno music plays]

106
00:04:05,621 --> 00:04:07,721
[techno music plays]
Oh, crap! Another facehugger.

107
00:04:07,721 --> 00:04:08,672
[techno music plays, explosion]

108
00:04:08,672 --> 00:04:09,761
[techno music plays]
Ha ha ha!

109
00:04:09,761 --> 00:04:11,465
[techno music plays]
Oh, that's just great.

110
00:04:11,465 --> 00:04:14,046
[techno music plays]
My enemy is the enemy of my other enemy.

111
00:04:14,046 --> 00:04:15,649
[techno music plays]
I wouldn't hate computers so much

112
00:04:15,649 --> 00:04:17,607
[techno music plays]
if they did more useful things like that.

113
00:04:17,607 --> 00:04:18,372
[techno music plays]

114
00:04:18,372 --> 00:04:19,551
[techno music plays]
I wonder if the guys in here

115
00:04:19,551 --> 00:04:20,477
[techno music plays]
died from the aliens

116
00:04:20,477 --> 00:04:22,512
[techno music plays, explosions]
or just raved themselves to death.

117
00:04:22,512 --> 00:04:23,597
[techno music plays, explosions]

118
00:04:23,597 --> 00:04:25,126
[techno music plays, explosions]
Okay, place is blowing up,

119
00:04:25,126 --> 00:04:25,898
[techno music plays, explosions]
time to leave.

120
00:04:25,898 --> 00:04:26,826
[techno music plays, explosions]

121
00:04:26,826 --> 00:04:29,267
[techno music plays, explosions]
Escape from techno hell!

122
00:04:30,042 --> 00:04:32,400
Hey, one of the guys is
fighting the facehugger!

123
00:04:32,891 --> 00:04:33,701
C'mon, hit it!

124
00:04:34,171 --> 00:04:35,989
Hit it with a stick!

125
00:04:35,989 --> 00:04:37,377
Aww...

126
00:04:37,377 --> 00:04:39,634
Those things really ARE facehuggers!

127
00:04:39,634 --> 00:04:41,964
I hope they don't bleed acid, too.

128
00:04:41,964 --> 00:04:43,834
I'm glad I watched the movie.

129
00:04:45,096 --> 00:04:47,644
Okay, twitching dead guy
and a strobe light.

130
00:04:47,644 --> 00:04:49,367
That's not creepy at all.

131
00:04:50,272 --> 00:04:52,234
I'm... just... gonna... go...

132
00:04:53,241 --> 00:04:53,734
...yeah...

133
00:04:55,423 --> 00:04:56,186
[gunshots]

134
00:04:56,186 --> 00:04:57,733
Hey-hey. Gunshots.

135
00:04:57,733 --> 00:05:00,056
Where there's a gun, there's fun.

136
00:05:00,056 --> 00:05:01,419
Or not.

137
00:05:01,419 --> 00:05:04,133
Uh-oh.  Uh, you need some help?

138
00:05:05,875 --> 00:05:07,557
Guess not, huh?

139
00:05:07,557 --> 00:05:08,267
Well...

140
00:05:09,279 --> 00:05:11,234
Whoa-ho-ho-ho, what's this?

141
00:05:11,896 --> 00:05:14,292
Your death was not in vain, pal.

142
00:05:14,292 --> 00:05:17,104
I'll shoot everyone in this
building if I have to.

143
00:05:17,104 --> 00:05:18,534
Welp, time to play God.

144
00:05:19,110 --> 00:05:21,764
Let's see people disrespect me now.

145
00:05:21,764 --> 00:05:24,200
They'll find out what happens
when you mess with the Freeman.

